<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-OSSIA eyes Rebel Sport stake - paper.</title>
<headline>RTRS-OSSIA eyes Rebel Sport stake - paper.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singaporean sporting goods retailer OSSIA International is interested in buying a 38 percent stake in Australian sporting goods retailer Rebel Sports Ltd, The Australian Financial Review newspaper reported on Friday.</p>
<p>Rebel said on Wednesday it had been formally approached by a party interested in buying a significant stake from Rebel Chairman Sam Linz, who owns about 38 percent of Rebel.</p>
<p>&quot;The Australian Financial Review understands the approach had been made by OSSIA,&quot; it said.</p>
</text>
